  "question": {
    "text": "<p>The set of all&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#8477;</mi></math>&nbsp;for which the equation&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>|</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>|</mo><mo>+</mo><mo>|</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>|</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> has exactly one real root, is</p>"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#8734;</mo></mrow></mfenced></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mo>&#8734;</mo><mo>,</mo><mo>&#8734;</mo></mrow></mfenced></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mo>&#8734;</mo><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>",
      "is_correct": false
